OL,3,GNEWSAChildhood 'taken from me' through
OL,4,Afake illnesses
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man whose mother falsely claimed he
OL,7,Fwas suffering from serious illnesses
OL,8,Fsays he will never regain his lost
OL,9,Fchildhood.
OL,11,FLisa Hayden-Johnson from Brixham won
OL,12,Fpublic sympathy for her fight for
OL,13,FMatthew Johnson's medical care after
OL,14,Fclaiming he was unable to walk, eat or
OL,15,Fbreathe without assistance - she was
OL,16,Fjailed in 2010 for three years and
OL,17,Fthree months for putting him through
OL,18,Funnecessary treatment.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
