OL,3,GNEWSAChildhood 'taken from me' through
OL,4,Afake illnesses
OL,5,
OL,6,FShe has now participated in a Channel 4
OL,7,Fdocumentary, as has her son, his sister
OL,8,FLaura, doctors from Torbay, social
OL,9,Fworkers and Devon police who
OL,10,Finvestigated.
OL,12,FJohnson, now 25, said participating in
OL,13,Fthe documentary helped as he "gained a
OL,14,Flot of useful information that I didn't
OL,15,Factually know".
